# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets reads this (like .gitignore, but it
# controls what [assets] in wrangler.toml is allowed to serve publicly,
# not what git tracks). [assets].directory is "." — the whole repo root —
# so anything not excluded here is a publicly fetchable file on
# skynet-ctf.org the moment it's deployed. This list exists specifically
# because check-answer.js's source (answer hashes included) was served as
# a plain public file before this existed — see src/index.js's top comment
# for the full story. When adding new non-public files at the repo root,
# add them here too; nothing is private by default under [assets].

src/
wrangler.toml
.assetsignore
.gitignore
CLAUDE.md
*.md
.git/
node_modules/
